---
title: "exchange_rate_calculation - sCoin Exchange Rate (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_supply: total_supply = pool underlying balance + outstanding borrows
    q_get_supply --> q_get_market_coin: total_market_coin = total minted sCoins
    q_get_market_coin --> q_check_zero: check total_market_coin > 0
    q_check_zero --> q_initial: total_market_coin == 0
    q_initial --> [*]: exchange_rate = 1.0 (initial rate)
    q_check_zero --> q_calc_rate: total_market_coin > 0
    q_calc_rate --> q_calc_price: exchange_rate = total_supply / total_market_coin
    q_calc_price --> [*]: scoin_price = underlying_asset_price * exchange_rate

    note right of q_calc_rate
        INV-001: exchange_rate = total_supply / total_market_coin
        INV-002: exchange_rate is monotonically non-decreasing over time
        INV-003: total_supply includes accrued interest from borrowers
        INV-004: scoin_price = underlying_asset_price * exchange_rate
    end note

    note right of q_initial
        INV-005: initial exchange_rate = 1.0 when no sCoins minted
        INV-006: exchange_rate increases as borrowers pay interest
    end note
